# bench --archive-runs output (src/bench/archive.ts): a results directory in bench/results now
# archives its runs' records by default, ~4 MB gz per 22-task slice. The un-ignore rules above
# would otherwise commit them on every bench run. A record archive is checked in DELIBERATELY and
# as one file, the way experiments/results/oos-2026-09-22-runs.tar.gz was.
bench/results/*/runs/
